# For editors only. Each script here is one piece of an agent: mkAgent
# (../daedalus-lib.nix) assembles the real script from the variables nix
# renders plus several of these files, so linted alone a file sees names
# set in another piece as unassigned (SC2154) and names it sets for a later
# piece as unused (SC2034). The build-time shellcheck (writeShellApplication)
# checks the assembled script with neither disabled, and is the real gate.
# Nix never reads this file.
disable=SC2034,SC2154
